Yes.  I don't know what I was thinking of when I wrote that, but
if something's happened to my pet, I'll definitely buy armor
whose price indicates magic, or a magic lamp.  Or scrolls
costing less than 100 (base price).  Also, unless I've already
got some from elsewhere, I'll buy food.  On the other hand,
non-magic armor generally isn't worth it, nor are weapons,
potions, rings nor any of the other stuff.

Finally, if I do still have my pet, I'll generally try to buy
all of the tripe before he gets it (and let him take care of the
rest).

